{#-
  The default `root-cause` kind's destination body: the authored sections in order, with three
  long parts collapsed so a person deciding on a phone scrolls past none of them.

  - `## Impact` keeps its parts before `**Cost of the workaround.**`; that part becomes a
    collapsed `Cost of the workaround` block whose first bullet is the record's workaround line,
    then a collapsed `Priority calculation` block holds the record's two severity lines and the
    estimate line. The values are the record's `impact`; the agent writes none of them.
  - `## Suggested fix` opens with its overview, when it has one, then a collapsed
    `Contributing locations` block, then its unit subsections.
  - Every other section is the authored one.

  Each block is written as ai-orchestrator's `collapsed()` writes it (8bf72a30,
  `orchestrator/follow_up_tickets.py`). Every variable README.md's "Templates" documents is
  given.
-#}
{%- set lines = rubric.impact_lines -%}
{%- set cost_label = rubric.impact_parts | last -%}
{%- set cost_part = "**" ~ cost_label ~ ".**" -%}
{%- set locations_part = "**Contributing locations.**" -%}
{%- set calculation -%}
- {{ lines | first }}: {{ record.impact[lines | first] }}
- {{ lines | last }}: {{ record.impact[lines | last] }}
{%- if estimate_line.line %}
{{ estimate_line.line }}
{%- endif %}
{%- endset -%}
{%- for section in ticket.sections %}
## {{ section.name }}

{% if section.name == "Impact" and record.impact and cost_part in section.content -%}
{%- set held = section.content | split(cost_part, 1) -%}
{{ held[0] | trim }}

{{ collapsed(cost_label, "- " ~ lines[1] ~ ": " ~ record.impact[lines[1]] ~ "\n" ~ (held[1] | trim)) }}

{{ collapsed("Priority calculation", calculation) }}
{% elif section.name == "Impact" and record.impact -%}
{{ section.content }}

{{ collapsed("Priority calculation", calculation) }}
{% elif section.name == "Suggested fix" and locations_part in section.content and "\n###" in section.content -%}
{%- set held = section.content | split(locations_part, 1) -%}
{%- set units = held[1] | split("\n###", 1) -%}
{%- if held[0] | trim %}{{ held[0] | trim }}

{% endif -%}
{{ collapsed("Contributing locations", units[0]) }}

###{{ units[1] }}
{% else -%}
{{ section.content }}
{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}
